    m_Untranslated: The <b>Replace Material</b> rule is now added to the <b>Replace
      Materials on Metadata</b> Rule Set. This allows your import process to include
      automatic material replacement without duplicating setup steps.
--- !u!114 &5809470791650426172
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "When building complex Rule Sets with multiple actions, it\u2019s
      best to break them into smaller, named sub-rules. This helps keep your logic
      organized and ensures that object selection is reset between major steps."
--- !u!114 &5929284874858877105
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "CAD models often lack smooth shading or contain inconsistent
      normal data, which can lead to harsh edges or incorrect lighting in Unity.
      To fix this, you can use the <b>Create Normals (Smoothness)</b> action from
      the <b>Unity Asset Transformer Toolkit (ATT)</b>. This tool recalculates normals
      across the model for smoother visual results.\nIn this step, you\u2019ll add
      another rule to your Rule Set to automatically generate smooth normals during
      import.\n"
--- !u!114 &5988846519689910067
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Rulesets let you automate transformation and import tasks using
      the <b>Unity Asset Transformer Toolkit (UATT)</b>. In this step, you\u2019ll
      create a dedicated folder to store your custom Rule Sets and add your first
      rule."
--- !u!114 &6340338763412464212
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
